    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It Is An Open World Insect Life simulator.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/af6145f7003bff7a852e45c7c6fcd368.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose an insect from those presented in the game. Each insect has its own characteristics. Upgrade the nest, increase the number of the colony. Gather things around the map to expand your nest and colony. Fight other insects and capture their nests. You have the option to recruit companions as a personal squad for easier progression through the game:</h2><li>several Types Of Insects<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/3fa0b377b07a09f994d714535ec48380.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div><br></li><li>Several types of nests with the possibility of updating<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/3b03fe427517a58305ad04cc3a4f5d52.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div><br></li><li>Increase the number of your colony<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/575418c622a81aeef2bfb2f597385b3c.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div> <br></li><li>Recruit part of the colony to your companions<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/5a55e08d11477bb83f592aef9830387a.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div> <br></li><li>\u0421ollect surrounding things and use them for upgrades<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/b86d36d50db92db436333113c6643ad3.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div></li></ul></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It Is An Open World Insect Life simulator.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/af6145f7003bff7a852e45c7c6fcd368.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose an insect from those presented in the game. Each insect has its own characteristics. Upgrade the nest, increase the number of the colony. Gather things around the map to expand your nest and colony. Fight other insects and capture their nests. You have the option to recruit companions as a personal squad for easier progression through the game:</h2><li>several Types Of Insects<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/3fa0b377b07a09f994d714535ec48380.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div><br></li><li>Several types of nests with the possibility of updating<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/3b03fe427517a58305ad04cc3a4f5d52.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div><br></li><li>Increase the number of your colony<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/575418c622a81aeef2bfb2f597385b3c.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div> <br></li><li>Recruit part of the colony to your companions<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/5a55e08d11477bb83f592aef9830387a.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div> <br></li><li>\u0421ollect surrounding things and use them for upgrades<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1866090/extras/b86d36d50db92db436333113c6643ad3.avif?t=1718554789\" /></div></li></ul></h2>",
